          "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}E(X)&=\\sum xP(X=x)\\\\E(X)&=0\\left(\\frac{81}{625}\\right)+1\\left(\\frac{216}{625}\\right)+2\\left(\\frac{216}{625}\\right)+3\\left(\\frac{96}{625}\\right)+4\\left(\\frac{16}{625}\\right)\\\\E(X)&=\\frac{216+432+288+64}{625}\\\\E(X)&=1.6\\text{ sales per hour}\\end{aligned}$$",
